# Only the site's public files go into the image (it is the docroot).
# Repo tooling and notes:
.git
**/.DS_Store
**/*.sh
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
config/
.kamal/
README.md
**/.gitignore
.github/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/node_modules
# Never ship secrets, keys, databases, dumps or archives, even if committed:
**/.env*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.sql
**/*.sql.gz
**/*.bak
**/*.tar
**/*.tar.gz
**/*.tgz
# From this repo's old deploy.sh excludes:
**/*.map
